From f096e5898a8f1116ea8e351d69726b83045bb438 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:05:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): follow the stop; operation at the top; abort per
 operation

The window lists through list_stop; operation and names come with
each list; a moved-on stop clears every per-stop state and opens the
next one with a notice for dropped edits. Abort names its operation.

Refs plan #87 #88 #89
